port/camera/ov2640_regs.c -- OV2640 QVGA RGB565 register sequence
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The register table in this file is data taken verbatim from STMicroelectronics'
OV2640 camera component driver:

    https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/stm32-ov2640  (v1.0.3, ov2640.c)

Only the `OV2640_QVGA[][2]` array is reused.  None of that driver's code is:
port/camera/camera.c walks the table with its own error-checked SCCB writes.

